Manticore Columnar Library 14.5.8 and two commits, the one of Manticore Search 32:
the modules that searchd of manticore32 loads from share/manticore/modules.
Columnar storage, secondary indexes, vector search (KNN) and auto embeddings
(safetensors and GGUF models of HuggingFace, or the APIs of OpenAI, Voyage and Jina;
no ONNX Runtime), each plain and for CPUs with AVX2 and AVX-512; built for
azsupport/ports.
